{"unit_id":"DEVbyQIN__dsh-session-tabs#card-zh","repo":"DEVbyQIN/dsh-session-tabs","commit":"aa4cb30dcc2ae78ab5798bb25affed94f7899d7b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-tabs 是供 DSH Web 客户端使用的会话标签插件。它在原生聊天视图上方加入可拖动的标签栏，并复用宿主的会话、导航和侧栏服务。用户可以切换或新建会话、关闭和恢复标签、调整顺序、查看运行状态，并从标签栏转发打开工作台及右侧栏的操作。标签身份和启用状态保存在浏览器本地，忙碌会话关闭标签后仍留在后台。适合需要同时整理多个 DSH 会话的用户；不需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:76-148","lib/client.js:299-341","cordis.patch.yml:10-12"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVbyQIN__dsh-session-tabs#card-en","repo":"DEVbyQIN/dsh-session-tabs","commit":"aa4cb30dcc2ae78ab5798bb25affed94f7899d7b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-tabs adds a session tab strip to DSH Web using native navigation. Users can switch, create, close, restore, and reorder tabs, see session status, and keep busy sessions running after closing a tab. Tab state is stored locally; no account or API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:76-148","lib/client.js:299-341","cordis.patch.yml:10-12"]}
